N                                       I2C_FLAG_TX_CPLT        | I2C_FLAG_BUSY                | \
N                                       I2C_FLAG_STOP           | I2C_FLAG_TRA                 | \
N                                       I2C_FLAG_RX_FULL        | I2C_FLAG_GENERAL_CALL        | \
N                                       I2C_FLAG_TX_EMPTY       | I2C_FLAG_SMBUS_DEFAULT_MATCH | \
