N                                    Modify return type of function SPI_DeInit
N   2023-12-15       CDT             Rename SPI_FLAG_OVERLOAD as SPI_FLAG_OVERRUN, SPI_FLAG_UNDERLOAD as SPI_FLAG_UNDERRUN
N                                    Modify API API_xxxConfig() to SPI_Setxxx() and refine SPI_SetSSValidLevel, modify SPI_IRQ_ALL -> SPI_INT_ALL
