N/**
N *******************************************************************************
N * @file  hc32_ll_tmr0.h
N * @brief This file contains all the functions prototypes of the TMR0 driver
N *        library.
N @verbatim
N   Change Logs:
N   Date             Author          Notes
N   2022-03-31       CDT             First version
