N   2022-03-31       CDT             First version
N   2022-10-31       CDT             Comments optimization
N   2023-06-30       CDT             Modify typo
N                                    Update about split 16bit register TMRA_BCSTR into two 8bit registers TMRA_BCSTRH and TMRA_BCSTRL
N                                    Delete union in stc_tmra_init_t structure
N   2023-09-30       CDT             Modify some of member type of struct stc_tmra_init_t and relate function about these member
N                                    Modify macro-definition value for group TMRA_Interrupt_Type/TMRA_Status_Flag
N   2024-06-30       CDT             API TMRA_DeInit() added return value
